      "id": "claim_26f4a502f92d482cb0f6f55146d4974d",
      "statement": "The v0.2.x milestone (phases 01-07, shipped as v0.1.24 to v0.2.1) introduced the app-owned TypeSafeClient Jev bean, the V6 interest-scoring schema, the background scoring sweep, and the query-time blend CTE behind the Priority view and tier badges; the v0.3.x milestone (phases 08-12, shipped as v0.3.0 to v0.3.1) added engagement capture (V7 schema), folded engagement into the learned-weight blend, made the split explainable in the UI, and added topic-suggestion gap discovery.",
